  "label": "Smudge Stick",
  "description": "A smudge stick is a bundle of dried herbs, most commonly sage, tied together and burned to release smoke for spiritual cleansing. This term is outside the image but necessary to understand the object being burned and its purpose. The text 'what's burning?' relies on the viewer knowing this object is a smudge stick to interpret the question as a reference to its ritual use.",
